sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    loop One or more subsequent requests
        CS->>CSMS: GetCertificateStatusRequest (ocspRequestData = hashes from configured (V2G) certificate chain SubCA's)
        CSMS-->>CS: GetCertificateStatusResponse (status = Accepted, ocspResult)
        Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted<br>ocspResult must be an OCSPResponse class as defined in IETF RFC 6960,<br>DER encoded (as defined in IETF RFC 6960), and then base64 encoded
    end
